<h2 class="subtitle mt-4">
    Operational Performance:
</h2>
<p>
    The year wise operational performance of Nathpa Jhakri HPS (NJHPS) &amp; Rampur HPS (RHPS) is as follows:
</p>
<div class="scroll-mobile">
    <table class="table common-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th colspan="2">
                    &nbsp;
                </th>
                <th colspan="2">
                    Gross Energy Generation (MU)
                </th>
                <th colspan="3">
                    Capacity index / PAF (%)
                </th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>
                    Sr. No.
                </th>
                <th>
                    FY:
                </th>
                <th>
                    NJHPS
                </th>
                <th>
                    RHPS
                </th>
                <th>
                    NJHPS
                </th>
                <th>
                    RHPS
                </th>
                <th>
                    &nbsp;
                </th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>

          {% for row in rows %}
            <tr>
                <td>
                    {{row.content['#view'].style_plugin.render_tokens[ loop.index0 ]['{{ field_sr_no }}'] }}
                </td>
                <td>
                    {{row.content['#view'].style_plugin.render_tokens[ loop.index0 ]['{{ title }}'] }}
                </td>
                <td>
                    {{row.content['#view'].style_plugin.render_tokens[ loop.index0 ]['{{ field_gross_energy_generation_mu }}'] }}
                </td>
                <td>
                   {{row.content['#view'].style_plugin.render_tokens[ loop.index0 ]['{{ field_mu_rhps }}'] }}
                </td>
                
                    <td>{{row.content['#view'].style_plugin.render_tokens[ loop.index0 ]['{{ field_capacity_index_paf_njhps }}'] }}</td>
                
                <td>
                  {{row.content['#view'].style_plugin.render_tokens[ loop.index0 ]['{{ field_capacity_index_paf_rhps }}'] }}
                </td>
                
            </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>
